WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
Marisa uses raw Drive Rush after the prerequisite held-Super knockdown.

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.650
Rush standing medium kick opens the waking Ryu.

3
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.900
Back heavy punch links into heavy Dimachaerus.

4
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.950
The forward-punch follow-up continues the launch.

5
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:04.650
Held back heavy punch catches the airborne Ryu.

6
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:05.950
Light Phalanx ends the recorded juggle.
